---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Which Panama Visa Is Right For You? — Objective Comparison"
  description="Objective comparison of Panama's 5 main visas: requirements, minimum income, process time, permanence and right to work. No bias toward any option."
  lang="en"
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">

    <div class="mb-10">
      <a href="/en/visas" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">← All visas</a>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate mt-4 mb-3">Which visa is right for you?</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-lg max-w-2xl">
        Objective comparison based on your profile — without pushing you toward any option.
        Every situation is different.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Full comparison table -->
    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-4">Side-by-side comparison</h2>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-jade/10 bg-white mb-12">
      <table class="w-full text-sm min-w-[640px]">
        <thead>
          <tr class="text-left border-b border-jade/10" style="background-color: #2D7D6F;">
            <th class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold text-white">Visa</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold text-white">Main requirement</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold text-white">Min. income / investment</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold text-white">Process time</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold text-white">Permanent?</th>
            <th class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold text-white">Work in Panama?</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-jade/5">
          <tr class="hover:bg-jade/3 transition-colors">
            <td class="px-4 py-4 font-medium text-jade">
              <a href="/en/visas/pensionado" class="hover:underline">🌴 Pensionado</a>
            </td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">Lifetime pension from any government or private source</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">$1,000/month</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">3–6 months</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 font-medium" style="color: #2D7D6F;">✓ Yes</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">No</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-jade/3 transition-colors bg-fog/50">
            <td class="px-4 py-4 font-medium text-jade">
              <a href="/en/visas/friendly-nations" class="hover:underline">🌐 Friendly Nations</a>
            </td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">Economic or professional ties to Panama (property, company, employment)</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">No fixed minimum</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">3–6 months</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">After 5 years</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">Yes (with work permit)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-jade/3 transition-colors">
            <td class="px-4 py-4 font-medium text-jade">
              <a href="/en/visas/digital-nomad" class="hover:underline">💻 Digital Nomad</a>
            </td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">Remote work contract with a non-Panamanian company</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">$3,000/month ($36K/year)</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">1–2 months</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4" style="color: #E8714A;">✗ Temporary (9 mo.)</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">No (foreign employers only)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-jade/3 transition-colors bg-gold/5">
            <td class="px-4 py-4 font-medium text-jade">
              <a href="/en/visas/qualified-investor" class="hover:underline">📈 Qualified Investor</a>
              <span class="block text-xs font-bold text-coral mt-0.5">⚡ Threshold rises Oct 2026</span>
            </td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">Investment in Panamanian real estate, stocks or fixed deposits</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">$300,000 (real estate)</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">2–4 months</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 font-medium" style="color: #2D7D6F;">✓ Yes (immediate)</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">No</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-jade/3 transition-colors bg-fog/50">
            <td class="px-4 py-4 font-medium text-jade">
              <a href="/en/visas/reforestation" class="hover:underline">🌳 Reforestation</a>
            </td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">Investment in a certified forestry or agri-reforestation project</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">$80,000</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">4–8 months</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 font-medium" style="color: #2D7D6F;">✓ Yes*</td>
            <td class="px-4 py-4 text-slate-mid">No</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-slate-mid border-t border-jade/5">
        * Reforestation permanence is conditional on maintaining the investment. Data references 2025–2026 — always verify with a licensed immigration attorney before applying.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Decision tree -->
    <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-6">Find your path</h2>
    <div class="space-y-6 mb-16">

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/10">
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate mb-4">Do you receive a lifetime pension of at least $1,000/month?</p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-jade mb-1">Yes →</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">The <a href="/en/visas/pensionado" class="text-jade hover:underline font-medium">Pensionado Visa</a> is almost certainly your best option. Permanent, with unique discounts and a proven process.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-fog border border-slate/10">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-mid mb-1">No → keep reading</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">There are other routes depending on your capital, income and nationality.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/10">
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate mb-4">Are you a national of the US, Canada, Spain, Colombia, Germany or another of the ~50 friendly nations?</p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-jade mb-1">Yes →</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">The <a href="/en/visas/friendly-nations" class="text-jade hover:underline font-medium">Friendly Nations Visa</a> is the most flexible route: no fixed minimum amount and accepts multiple income sources (remote, rental, business).</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-fog border border-slate/10">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-mid mb-1">No →</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">Your route goes through investment: Qualified Investor, Reforestation, or if you work remotely, the Digital Nomad.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/10">
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate mb-4">Do you have $300,000+ to invest in Panamanian real estate?</p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-jade mb-1">Yes →</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">The <a href="/en/visas/qualified-investor" class="text-jade hover:underline font-medium">Qualified Investor Visa</a> gives immediate permanent residency. Check current amounts — the threshold increases in Oct. 2026.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-fog border border-slate/10">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-mid mb-1">No / prefer not to lock up that capital →</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">With $80,000 in a forestry project you can qualify for the <a href="/en/visas/reforestation" class="text-jade hover:underline font-medium">Reforestation Visa</a>. Or if you work remotely, start with the <a href="/en/visas/digital-nomad" class="text-jade hover:underline font-medium">Digital Nomad</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-jade/10">
        <p class="font-semibold text-slate mb-4">Do you work remotely for a foreign company earning $3,000+/month?</p>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-jade mb-1">Yes →</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">The <a href="/en/visas/digital-nomad" class="text-jade hover:underline font-medium">Digital Nomad Visa</a> is your fastest entry point. Temporary (9 months), but ideal for getting to know the country first.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-fog border border-slate/10">
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-mid mb-1">No →</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-mid">Your case deserves specific review. The quiz helps orient you, or we can connect you with a professional.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mb-2">Still not clear?</p>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mb-5">The quiz asks the key questions and guides you in 2 minutes.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
        <a href="/en/visas" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-jade text-jade font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade/5 transition-colors">
          ← Back to all visas
        </a>
        <a href="/en/quiz" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-jade text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade-dark transition-colors">
          Take the quiz →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>
</Layout>
